# CMS Block System Rules (PrimeWeb)

## Block Architecture
Mỗi Block Type có 3 phần tách rời:
```
src/blocks/{block-name}/
├── config.ts          ← Payload CMS field definition (schema)
├── Component.tsx      ← SSR render component (cho published site)
└── Editor.tsx         ← Editor UI component (cho visual editor)
```

## Block Config Pattern (Payload CMS)
```typescript
import type { Block } from 'payload'

export const HeroBlock: Block = {
  slug: 'hero',
  labels: { singular: 'Hero Banner', plural: 'Hero Banners' },
  imageURL: '/blocks/hero-preview.png',
  fields: [
    {
      name: 'variant',
      type: 'select',
      defaultValue: 'centered',
      options: [
        { label: 'Centered', value: 'centered' },
        { label: 'Split (Image Right)', value: 'split' },
        { label: 'Fullscreen Background', value: 'fullscreen' },
      ],
    },
    { name: 'heading', type: 'text', required: true },
    { name: 'subheading', type: 'textarea' },
    { name: 'ctaText', type: 'text', defaultValue: 'Get Started' },
    { name: 'ctaLink', type: 'text', defaultValue: '#contact' },
    { name: 'backgroundImage', type: 'upload', relationTo: 'media' },
  ],
}
```

