## Available Block Types (Current)
1. `navigation` — Site header/menu
2. `hero` — Main banner (centered/split/fullscreen)
3. `about` — About section (image-left/image-right/grid)
4. `features` — Feature cards (3-col/2-col grid)
5. `testimonials` — Customer reviews (grid/carousel)
6. `contact` — Contact form + map
7. `gallery` — Image gallery (masonry/grid)
8. `footer` — Site footer

## Planned Block Types (Phase 2+)
9. `pricing` — Pricing table
10. `blog-list` — Blog post grid
11. `faq` — Accordion FAQ
12. `cta` — Call-to-action banner
13. `stats` — Statistics/numbers section
14. `team` — Team members grid
15. `video` — Video embed section
16. `logo-cloud` — Partner/client logos

## Rules
- Blocks must be self-contained (no cross-block dependencies)
- Theme colors applied via CSS variables, NOT hardcoded colors
- Every block MUST have at least 2 variants
- Block content must be serializable to JSON (for Payload storage)
- Published site blocks = Server Components (SSR, no JavaScript)
- Editor blocks = Client Components (interactive, with state)
